CMOS inverter: pMOS pull-up, nMOS pull-down
in  pMOS  nMOS  out
0   ON    off   1  (joined to the supply)
1   off   ON    0  (joined to ground)

Wrong build: nMOS used as the pull-up too
in  up    nMOS  out
0   off   off   Z  (floating: joined to nothing)
1   ON    ON    X  (both conduct: supply shorted to ground)
